Objective:
Create a Simple Calculator using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
Requirements:
 Two input fields for numbers.
 Four buttons:
o Add
o Subtract
o Multiply
o Divide
Functionality:
 On button click, perform the selected operation.
 Display result below the buttons.
Validation:
 Inputs should not be empty.
 Inputs should allow only numbers.
 Handle division by zero.